  "lyrics": [
    "Intro:",
    "",
    "1 Verse:",
    "When God inhabits our praises,",
    "Heaven opens, everything changes",
    "So get ready now, oh get ready now",
    "",
    "2 Verse:",
    "So let everything that is breathing,",
    "Enter in with praise and thanksgiving",
    "So get ready now, oh get ready now",
    "",
    "Pre Chorus:",
    "Join with the angels around the throne,",
    "Singing the song that never gets old",
    "As long as I've got breath in these lungs,",
    "Oh I will",
    "",
    "Chorus:",
    "Praise the Lord, oh my soul,",
    "Praise the Lord, oh my soul",
    "",
    "3 Verse:",
    "Shout for joy, King Jesus is present,",
    "And He loves the sound of His children",
    "When we're singing out, oh keep singing out",
    "",
    "2 Chorus:",
    "Praise the Lord, oh my soul,",
    "Praise the Lord, oh my soul",
    "As long as I've got breath in these lungs,",
    "I'll sing and I'll never stop",
    "Praise the Lord, praise the Lord",
    "",
    "Instrumental:",
    "",
    "",
    "Bridge: x2",
    "Watch what God can do,",
    "When praises fill the room",
    "Watch what God can change,",
    "When we lift up His name",
    "",
    "2 Bridge:",
    "Watch the walls fall down,",
    "Watch it turn around",
    "Watch the mountains move,",
    "There's nothing He can't do",
    "",
    "3 Chorus:",
    "Praise the Lord, oh my soul,",
